{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他因熟悉的亲近而满心欢喜，想把藏着的话告诉对方，却始终没有真正开口。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欢喜、心动、迫切、犹豫、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"他希望对方也喜欢自己不再小心收着的样子，以及害怕说太多让对方为难、破坏两人原有自在的顾虑，需要读底部整段才能完整抓到。声线和水波的具体描写也不容易一眼读完。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他很享受眼下的亲近，越来越想说出心里话、留住这一刻，但又担心开口会改变两人的关系。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"满心欢喜、心动、急切、紧张、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"盼着说出来能让眼下的美好持续更久，以及害怕对方为难、失去原有自在的具体原因，需要逐句读底部灰色文字；中间红色小字里的倒数感也容易漏掉。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想趁着两人亲近，把藏着的话说出来，想留住眼下的美好，却又怕说出口后反而失去原来的自在，最终仍然有所保留。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欢喜、心动、迫切、喉咙发紧、犹豫、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的高音像夕阳金光、音乐逐渐收弱、话到喉咙口发紧等细节，集中在中间三行红字里，一眼不容易完整抓到。对方是否也喜欢他真实、不再小心收着的一面，也需要读长句。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 4,\n  \"main_problem\": \"主要问题是视觉上的信息层级不够集中：顶部标题、中间珊瑚红大字、底部灰色大字都是较长且醒目的句子，三处都在表达想说又不敢说的不同层次，第一眼需要在几个区域之间跳转。第3张又在中间增加三行红色说明，进一步占据注意力。好在这些内容实际讲的是同一个人的亲近、心动、想表达和害怕失去，情绪与处境的联系很自然，串联本身没有明显问题。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4ad40180-9737-4f40-b01f-70889b4abbce", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T000132847783Z", "elapsed_seconds": 98.937, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:03:11.788406+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "070d9d69cd7a5954c3ab66658072128451ee1d7ea9c5056e1e211173a0143ad9", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T000132847783Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "5567493fdbdc49b4c3597e63eb6f4f8726724b1105535d10f5c8f8d28dadae2b"}}}
